//nt.gov.au/leisure/sport/sport-and-swim-vouchers/learn-to-swim-vouchers-for-your-child","media_type":"IMAGE","media_url":"https://scontent-syd2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t39.30808-6/552702646_1162837169208725_5111566319712645299_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=vMw1Jkou5MUQ7kNvwFq0Lw6&_nc_oc=Adm-_iGtOYPTO0W0-rFoRtfM5GCNuEd1JBd8fHbrF5jy8cchdYbc-UDEa-wCO8Wp2Co&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-syd2-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AM6HXa8EAAAA&_nc_gid=hccv4MxpZoEet1Hdg2_W9A&oh=00_Afpq5TbPIb1jsv-HAwolA5tw1tz_1yS9Xz0A4Hy65BtB6Q&oe=69829DF8","media_product_type":"FEED","permalink":"https://www.instagram.com/p/DO9kEA2gWVs/","shortcode":"DO9kEA2gWVs","timestamp":"2025-09-23T22:43:01+0000","like_count":5,"comments_count":0,"id":"17898883971279919"},{"caption":"We’re still buzzing with excitement after our incredible third meeting of the 2025 NT Youth Round Table! 🤩 In case you missed it, check out some of the highlights👇\\n\\n💡 Expressed their ideas, concerns and suggestions to the Minister for Youth, Seniors and Equality, the Minister for Education and Training, and executives from the Department of People, Sport and Culture, and the Department of Education and Training\\n👩‍🎓 Engaged in professional development and team building workshops with @eventful_learning_co and @balanced_choice focusing on project development and storytelling \\n📱 Participated in workshops on social media with Aidan McGregor, the 2025 Round Table Media and Communications Coordinator \\n🙌 Enjoyed morning tea with the Children’s Commissioner of the NT @childrenscommissionernt\\n💭 Explored and provided feedback on the development of a gender equity strategy for the NT\\n\\n...and so much more! 😎\\n\\nFind out more about the Round Table 🔗 youth.nt.gov.au\\n\\n#YouthNT #NTYouthRoundTable #NTYRT25","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","media_url":"https://scontent-syd2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/552638826_18421841833102337_28056803793